cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GEO-Optimizer: Generative Engine Optimization Toolchain"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "GEO-Optimizer"
    email: "52859273@qq.com"
abstract: >-
  GEO-Optimizer is an open-source toolchain for Generative Engine
  Optimization (GEO), helping websites achieve better citation rankings
  across 11 AI search engines including ChatGPT Search, Perplexity,
  Google AI Overviews, Doubao, Qwen, and more. Features include
  dual-engine scoring, LLM-powered content generation, multi-platform
  export, and continuous ranking monitoring.
version: 1.0.0
